"/farmland-atlas/missouri/howell-county"],["ARC or PLC in Howell County","/arc-plc/missouri/howell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Howell County came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years since 1951 for both January to February and April to May. In 2025 the middle ran 217% of normal in April to May and just 43% in November to December. Grid 20252 had its driest year in 1953 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
